Astera had asked to measure on the latest stepping B0 CXL card and FW. It is still showing the lower remote performance that started with FW 1.2.0.
Remove the transferred and transferred ID since it got rejected in sighting central.
@Jeppesen, Mark C  this issue needs further debug to make sure it is just Astera CXL card or their fw. For now this has customer impact.
Based on internal performance testing completed, the regression is only observed in 3rd party Astera CXL FW release. Astera has not provided much input for debug or support in resolving the regression since they are move focused on newer gen CXL devices and platforms. Closing the HSD as 3rd party/won't fix. If they do respond with an effort to look into this further we can reopen to document that progress.

