@Pan, Lijun , ok you are right. Checking more log, the regression appear after we upgrade from 6.6.0-gnr.bkc.6.6.29.3.43.x86_64 to 6.6.0-gnr.bkc.6.6.31.1.45.x86_64. (8S BKC skipped 6.6.30 version) Sorry for the mistake, I overlooked it in the previous version because I mixed it with another call trace https://hsdes.intel.com/appstore/article-one/article/15017181044 Can we get any useful information from the memory dump in the log?
